Fonts
-----
The console (/app) self-hosts two typefaces from fonts/, both under the SIL Open Font
License, Version 1.1 (full text next to the files). Only the Latin (Jost) and Devanagari
(Noto Sans Devanagari) subsets were taken, as published in the @fontsource npm packages
v5.3.0; the font names and files are otherwise unchanged.

